{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>And it split</b> — four times in the Masorah: ותבקע האדמה, and the others: ותבקע הארץ בקולם, and ותבקע העיר of Jeremiah and Kings concerning Jerusalem — ותבקע הארץ בקולם — and that is why it is written: \"and all Israel who were around them fled at their voice\" — a hint to that which is stated in Eruvin, that the opening of Gehenna is in Jerusalem, ותבקע העיר, meaning in Jerusalem, there ותבקע האדמה and they descended to Sheol:"], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:25.250951735Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}